    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The Oath of the Ancients is as old as the elven race and the rituals of the druids. Sometimes called fey knights, green knights, or horned knights, the paladins who swear this oath side with the light in the cosmic struggle against darkness because they love the beautiful and life-giving things of the world, not necessarily because they believe in principles of honor, courage, and justice. They adorn their armor and clothing with images of growing things, such as leaves, antlers, or flowers, as a sign of their commitment to preserving life and light in the world.</p><h4>Tenets of the Ancients</h4><p>The tenets of the Oath of the Ancients have been kept for countless centuries. This oath places the principles of good above any concern for law or chaos, and its four central principles are simple.</p><p><strong>Kindle the Light.</strong> Through your acts of mercy, kindness, and forgiveness, kindle the light of hope in the world and drive back despair.</p><p><strong>Shelter the Light.</strong> Where there is good, beauty, love, and laughter in the world, stand against the wickedness that would devour it. Where life flourishes, stand against the forces that would leave it barren.</p><p><strong>Preserve Your Own Light.</strong> Delight in song and laughter, in beauty and art. If you let the light die in your own heart, you can’t preserve it in the world.</p><p><strong>Be the Light.</strong> Be a glorious beacon for all who live in despair. Let the light of your joy and courage shine through all your deeds.</p><h4>Oath Spells</h4><p>You gain oath spells at the paladin levels listed.</p><table><caption>Oath of the Ancients Spells</caption><thead><tr><td>Paladin Level</td><td>Spells</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.legacy-spells.Item.PPehYsBEFwzeEmCV]{Ensnaring Strike}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.aL1F8fvYLtNzUbKu]{Speak with Animals}</td></tr><tr><td>5th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.bV3yun6MIuFj71Er]{Moonbeam}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.wqfAVANuQonNBgnL]{Misty Step}</td></tr><tr><td>9th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.YWtwzp6ZnQJMEmVW]{Plant Growth}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.j8NtLXOOJ3GAKF8I]{Protection from Energy}</td></tr><tr><td>13th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.WN2LWEljYU6QqnRH]{Ice Storm}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.ReMbjfeOKoSj3O79]{Stoneskin}</td></tr><tr><td>17th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.dp6xny4v8PDoIGjh]{Commune with Nature}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.DUBgwHPakcLDkB6W]{Tree Stride}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
